{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31506","headline":"竞渡时在湖外偶爲成章 · 李羣玉","name":"竞渡时在湖外偶爲成章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雷奔电逝三千儿，彩舟画檝射初晖。\n喧江雷鼓鳞甲动，三十六龙衔浪飞。\n灵均昔日投湘死，千古沈魂在湘水。\n绿草斜烟日暮时，笛声幽远愁江鬼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}